      "text": "Naive (one stage, flip at once, SIGKILL): 44 MB of build leftovers, a token in the history, hundreds of failed requests.\nMulti-stage + readiness + graceful SIGTERM: 1 MB on top of the base, nothing secret in the layers, zero failed requests.",
